step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test if a single strong model (ARIMA) outperforms the current trimmed‑mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ARIMA"}

Thought: Test a median combination over the most stable pool to see if it improves on the best single ARIMA.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a median combination over pool2 to see if a slightly larger stable pool improves on best single ARIMA.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a median combination over the largest stable pool (pool3) to see if adding more models improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Try a weighted combination using inverse error on the stable pool1 to see if it beats the best single ARIMA.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["ARIMA","THETA","rf","FT_rf","NaiveMovingAverage"],"weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a simple mean over pool4 to see if the baseline mean beats weighted inverse_error.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a median combination over pool4 to see if swapping FT_catboost for NaiveMovingAverage improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Try a robust Damped Bayesian Aggregation (dba) on the larger pool3 to see if it improves over the current best median and weighted combos.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool3","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test trimmed_mean over pool3 to see if a larger stable pool improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","models":["ARIMA","THETA","rf","DWT_rf","FT_rf","CWT_catboost"],"trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a dba combination on pool1 to see if a more aggressive aggregation improves over the current best single ARIMA.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a median combination over pool5 to see if adding CWT_catboost improves robustness.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool5"}

Thought: Test a simple mean over pool5 to see if adding CWT_catboost improves over previous mean pool4.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","models":["ARIMA","THETA","rf","DWT_rf","FT_rf","CWT_catboost"]}

